# Apex - Official Website

## Project Objective

The objective of this project is to create a professional startup website using semantic HTML elements.

This project demonstrates the use of HTML structure, navigation, forms, tables, multimedia, and embedded content.

## Features Implemented

- Semantic HTML structure
- Header and Navigation Bar
- Hero Section
- About and Features Section
- Services Section
- Team Section
- Contact Form with validation attributes
- HTML Table
- Video Embedding
- Google Maps Integration
- Footer Section
- Ordered and Unordered Lists
## Folder Structure

Day-01-HTML/
│
├── assets/
│   ├── images/
│   │   └── larkimage.jpg
│   │
│   ├── icons/
│   │
│   └── vedios/
│       └── Larkvedio.mp4
│
├── index.html
│
└── README.md

## How to Run

1. Download or clone this project.
2. Open the Day-01-HTML folder.
3. Open the index.html file in any web browser.
4. The Apex website will be displayed.

